    "text": "selmasun.com\nwebsite\nSelma\nBlack Belt Bayou Bash to be featured in Levitt concert on July 25\nBy Nathan Prewett,\n8 hours agoBlack Belt Bayou Bash will be part of an upcoming Levitt AMP Music Series concert in Selma on Saturday, July 25. The event will feature the Jukebox Brass Band and Rockin' Dopsie and the Zydeco Twisters. The series is sponsored in part by the Mortimer & Mimi Levitt Foundation and...",
